    "body": "Review blocker fixed in 8ccb4979 (PR stays draft).\n\n- frame.rs now collects the dialog wait (`take_waited()`) before the \"ui\" mark as well as before \"commands\", so a browse opened from a panel (tool-library export/import, tool body import) is excused in the phase it happened in and nothing carries into the next frame.\n- `FrameWatch::excuse` now takes `now` and clamps the shift so neither stamp passes it.\n- Reworded \"furniture\" in validate.rs (2 messages), fixture.rs and the repair_model MCP description.\n- Pin: frame_watch::a_wait_inside_the_ui_phase_is_excused_and_the_next_frame_is_clean (ui wait not slow, next frame unaffected, real slow work in commands and ui still reported, over-long wait clamped); the existing modal-dialog test updated to the new signature.\n- Gate: ui --lib frame_watch (5) and setup_stock (4), app fixtures + repair_model, clippy -D warnings ui+app clean; Linux quick gate: 4 steps, 0 failed.",
